Lessons folded into sci-stwin.mjs the same day: a parent part's own text (shared data) now reaches the
blind solver and checker (`lead`); mark codes on "Accept:" lines are not counted; grader notes
("Do not accept", "Award …") may follow the Answer line; the checker fails a scheme only for a DIFFERENT
correct answer it leaves out, not a rewording the grader credits anyway; the brief tells the author so.
